    <!-- Added by hand from PAL's tiago_moveit_config SRDF: pairs inside the
         arm / wrist / gripper chain that PAL disables but the Setup Assistant
         sampling did not. Their meshes overlap at normal wrist angles (e.g.
         arm_5_link and wrist_ft_link), so MoveIt reported a self-collision
         at a valid pose and refused to plan from it. -->
